    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414790/extras/16c8e91cbc8de59ab8ba0dc9bb1c305b.poster.avif?t=1729050497\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414790/extras/16c8e91cbc8de59ab8ba0dc9bb1c305b.webm?t=1729050497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414790/extras/16c8e91cbc8de59ab8ba0dc9bb1c305b.mp4?t=1729050497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Food Magician is an fantasy action-adventure game that filled with hidden treasures, dangerous creatures, and ancient ruins.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A New Adventure Is Waiting For You</h2>Get ready for an epic journey through a realm filled with danger, mystery, and adventure. In <strong>Food Magician</strong>, you'll be a brave magician on a quest to save the world from evil power.  Explore a beautiful fantasy world filled with hidden treasures, dangerous creatures, and ancient ruins waiting to be discovered. With a mix of thrilling combat and challenging puzzles, your story will be told.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414790/extras/9466d24bf349d0d179164f35ba5476a3.poster.avif?t=1729050497\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414790/extras/9466d24bf349d0d179164f35ba5476a3.webm?t=1729050497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414790/extras/9466d24bf349d0d179164f35ba5476a3.mp4?t=1729050497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As you progress through the game, you'll encounter a different characters, each with their own unique stories and motivations.  The game features various gameplay mechanics, including <strong>real-time combat</strong>, <strong>traps</strong>, and <strong>puzzle-solving</strong>. You'll need make quick decisions, to use all of your skills and wits to overcome the challenges that lie ahead.<br><br>With stunning graphics, beautiful music, and a rich and detailed world to explore, <strong>Food Magician</strong> is sure to provide hours of entertainment and excitement. Are you ready to embark on the adventure of a lifetime?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414790/extras/8cfd8efde75392932944a71ebf4b2f67.poster.avif?t=1729050497\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414790/extras/8cfd8efde75392932944a71ebf4b2f67.webm?t=1729050497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414790/extras/8cfd8efde75392932944a71ebf4b2f67.mp4?t=1729050497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414790/extras/24f220b4793598ad2206d01857453220.avif?t=1729050497\" /></span><br>* 2 modes of difficulties: Normal and Hell<br>* 4 major regions of game world<br>* More than 20+ types of monsters<br>* Lots of traps and puzzles<br>* Hours of adventures",
